# 0014 section 10.7 (ah): the checks of the band correction, 2026-10-27

The sections dated 2026-10-27 are the runs as they gave them, on the band then served, 0.77 to 1.18
(their test names say so). From 2026-10-28 (the third addendum to (ah), round 19) the band was 0.77 to
1.13, and since round 20 (the fourth addendum applied) it is 0.77 to 1.17; the last section re-runs every
planted error on that code.

