## 2026-10-28, after the merge with main (f88ecbe, A5): tests/base/tn2360-served.test.ts, every TN 2360 base pressure against the band served

On the merged head: 424 values at Mach 1.5 and 2.0, none outside, none refused; the closest the body alone
at M 1.5, 0.1948 against the band's 0.1958. Errors planted one at a time (restored after each):
tn2360-band-stale: bodyBaseDrag's high end at 1.08; tn2360-chord-station: a trailing edge exactly a chord
ahead no longer at TN 2360's x/c 1.0 station; tn2360-misread: fig. 33's W1 first reading at M 1.5 typed
-0.1998 for -0.1948, and tn2360-fig6-misread: fig. 6's first run of four 10% arcs at x/c 0, M 1.5, typed
-0.1691 for -0.1391. The two code errors are caught by this test. The two misreads are not: they move the
bands built on those data with them (the band to 1.16; the factor's members); the tests that hold the data
catch them (compiled-curve.test.ts below; fins-on-base-w1.test.ts and fins-on-base.test.ts for
the second).

